    "directions": [
      "Heat oil in a non-stick pan, add baby potatoes along with turmeric and stir fry until they turn light pink in color. Remove & keep aside.",
      "To the same pan, add whole spices and cook for a minute. Now add ginger, garlic and onion and cook until it turns soft. Now add the chicken pieces, cumin powder, red chili powder and turmeric and cook for 3-4 minutes. Keep stirring occasionally.",
      "Add the cherry tomatoes, garam masala and half cup of water or stock. Add the half-cooked potatoes, cover-cook for 5-7 minutes more until all the water is absorbed.",
      "Remove, transfer to the serving dish and serve hot with rice."
    ],
